  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5edcc9583959420cc576fda2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝――！迷いも甘えも、\r\n一刀両断いたしましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e0e005ad672f4b67412af7d6b56309f8231c3fde4ba361156f016134c601c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751550e561dc337b069d1348",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤエノムテキ、推して参る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d246e213ef99773543dda36a3ffb56b74fb83353e35ad83888afde7ca1a52c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd51cb94ed392c902c59352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4455be73df06b0d173582d85f4e48a9d5ab9b02279c6d289e09f5c000e28ca29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e040d7baf63823d9e733c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用你教给我的，\r\n靠谱的方法努力！\r\n为了防止暴走……我会注意的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d8f00b023833c1b22d0c1de4e8ad60ff4b58e7b54b26a2a039ae42f5a86141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5797207fecedc12916d3b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a000a75494ce638741fae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0911e22207ebd4e5b2465a4d2378a3328e0057ddd0a0764d77344297201735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9eedfac4301b7f1190d77b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为靠谱的刚志！\r\n我会多多努力成为一个\r\n可靠的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9b6d848eaad0af4d257dcd9a5f85463a259d40145a423d4261d9b43c05c2ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b965f2ff3ee2a536fba4321c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次一定要让训练员吃\r\n『爆肉金刚套餐』，\r\n变得满身肌肉！哦~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25e721a44abc92236a6f322eb6d1cf8d3b88aff8e34b1e155055ea3b5d44b39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4389e865a7e4fe00b24d4b0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n今年的目标是『健康第一』\r\n『火力全开』『突破极限』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d82eab8d3a73a53ed875377a0781a0b9b9cb1cef5a6a92054cc923630a6058c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ee9812b501d32f084132d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『悄悄做了一些巧克力』\r\n——好！就把这个说给会长听吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d19f985cd14076b31b4b2d0b3c0343d9bd7c3c97da258c6848db1314f9127105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bafb3b6d5edf673da55444e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我超级超级、超~级用心地\r\n做了这些充满热情的点心！\r\n请收下这份炽热的心意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4cd601adc44536df0b73352cac4816d9fde17f9262002ae4b310657b3bed7db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1b3d053f26733e4f5469a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想以自己的干劲让天空放晴…！\r\n让织女和牛郎相遇！\r\n呜喔喔！天空，放晴吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8df30cbda782aba1b6cda6e7754b59df68312ddfc54a18995f74b83ba4d48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab9ae501900ba51d9aeeda0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托弟弟妹妹的福，\r\n我已经习惯了恶作剧。\r\n不管怎么恶作剧我都没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b743785ec4b7c2b5aff89fa5fa9fdec5b0caae8e74176506caea0d571d5b4382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc612e6e06152fceb7b7f6ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给家里的圣诞礼物\r\n应该送到了吧？\r\n大家会喜欢吗~？嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6debbce68b0d8ef7bed94c60141bf051ebb32383352a96a8afb4f93713a2ebc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:749ae493a921e78d4996512d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门去逛逛吗？\r\n今年想要精神饱满地迎接\r\n新的一天，全力享受当下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e7e6c2c7d29f2f6c4a1e12d74d936c37daec3a905511733ffe64ed9c2a57a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbba592742a168197daeacc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c0677a83e18888e595c5c3558a426a26a82fa21bee1c8e97470099a4b7d98a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a6a6e686c17fe9c98dddebe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年倒计时绝对\r\n不能睡着！不能倒下！\r\n要和大家一起跨年……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4fbe73da6851619c3d42156bd8f4130553a69f8eb66641e320700967a0aab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f009a8c1aca4afe7b5a52f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n就让我大师・刚志来为你\r\n热烈庆祝吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "070a919bcde463dea0fb189b83dacc353308f2b578aaeedb41e126fd30d9c4cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836275ca356208049b73f17a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『破天爆裂健康香草茶』和\r\n『古今无双超大份蛋糕』\r\n已经准备好了！快尽情享用吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe5439f1348494b1cd1072d582bc9531adddf6fddf486927e45126fab1c30b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21174fe7d1ce276b693a012f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然收到了这么多礼物～…！\r\n为了回报大家的温柔，\r\n我要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b1ab2043761fdaaa3b83961fa3f8f33031d5b1bf8d189d0dd75211ee9035e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf0fd02c4da1af4a77906a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想做的事，吗？那就让我来\r\n帮训练员！……诶，不行吗？\r\n就通融一下嘛……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ace159bf0fdb318c1784c1c31aab96111ffec96e0bd74c79c0c767db8e8619f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c91bc14f2298d68264724cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知来了。\r\n一起去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5016b628541211b7c742cb60dee713be6b907bf0e051463a6a69142c383a4735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23df0fa11aeb0eca9d914794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了哦！\r\n赶紧来打开看看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd6c1d1ead14e78d4d7fb66d81cf79d81b333f3b983473d1c934ed729e7448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147e0a0a0ec47fc492cdd1c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦~任务完成了！\r\n我也得加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "131c1c6eff347a1a039404a026850066cf7e2086151894c3b78578e74decbcad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ab55037704155e0e08a461",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快开始了！\r\n得赶紧调理好身体……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "144e0c1d662be96c33438a7f91f215b77045c89217c74c76545e4cb259fcf6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050a6353a39348d37ac22e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了！\r\n那就精神满满地Let's go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b961ad773bdb05d8685137288b16c4fbd02473338269a68aa36cce5a5a842a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207bd0302f8bc6f2a2e9d94e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有任何不甘心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f07d6794e36d878c66cad4b72c54adbb04ee94cb18b905e1c4ac31eb341e449",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f80b86fef4e76237437c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "图鉴等级上升了！\r\n务必务必去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b972d50406ecf10e3996cf256f08e3cb0a1b9b4899e951fd11e1f18e9a34078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db1638d75dc9906fbbfe07f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管去哪里外套都是必需的！\n要是不能保证体温的话\n会很难受的……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a6209a00426fb825aeaa928a5cb927894d95da6354506ef4880c56bede4b03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb79b93169d0f223dea90e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿靴子的话脚就不冷了很舒服呢～\n然后只要注意别闷着脚就行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a0037993eed6518cb896e9493390d974d51a4e0b1678ac4c0b81f645c7d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19aca7ca4ab9c9812f3dbfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微试了一下会长的黑色内搭……\n果然成熟又帅气呢。诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f1d7e4faef2a1fcb307fbe112d9c426a8d4dec06062a2978bc2d29de0df10b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32ac0db4dddfa4a1cbf25b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家也都很厉害啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c6015990ac00091fea617f62ba87124eb7ecc182f149151057c0f35a0ddb48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d751f146d71d5d38f46f502f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是努力得来的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61292f5fb1ee938c05aa7ec878da35100078a4c2e14fbd14cd5b4ebd16e4dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4896ef38182fce775fd6acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有任何不甘心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f07d6794e36d878c66cad4b72c54adbb04ee94cb18b905e1c4ac31eb341e449",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad2706f936ef5f2b622e5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家也都很厉害啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c6015990ac00091fea617f62ba87124eb7ecc182f149151057c0f35a0ddb48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828edd847a6e393c9408ae6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新纪录达成~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10695809233e3c51a31e9fd162ab737f14bcc37773f2ce6a937e08d0f66d834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bbdaff364a0177732ed8653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鼓起干劲加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f89f2442834ae040846ca8878831da566305c89dbd997a7d79dc9f634846206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47aee1aa98b992e71641d83d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4519eaa670ee4f009be5cb55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练对吧，好啊！\r\n我会全力跟上……\r\n——唔哇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "375ea68b76367a22a9e08f1ed6a75c706d98e447e99921cb0c61980d671854a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c58815e307fbcdec5d73b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到大家努力的样子，\r\n自己也会紧绷起来呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46f98b507fbe53d758a8d73bda694b0c36446539f1984f599360e8f86bf1eb56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8549584c99f27afba543374d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛对吧！明白啦！\r\n这就去准备超多护理用品！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6a93ade885dc2ac581ae1e4ac0608d990ff4dc12ce81304505339e245b4dcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb2ea5e781ac7e5187fabdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff63a291fb7031f651a7b18d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哦哦，热情涌上来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a1339ff671c8cb5487d9a48baa53057421b12b4e093133814f93fff05477c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3209620bf059afd7bebef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请好好看着吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4787a25dd1026f8cf549f5f4f25f40c31489449e021b048aa68bc4bbd34aac55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03093ffcb4c027af38f2ba77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前进！",
